{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:cfdd3cdabc9ae0fa","name":"Skim the Surface","source":{"id":"source:reference-cfdd3cdabc9ae0fa","title":"Skim the Surface","revision":18793,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:44:48Z","sha256":"f27d98aeecb0a7cf3cc19d2998d376b4b595e01c3f5e79c3084d64adaea86d96","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18793","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Skim%20the%20Surface&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-cfdd3cdabc9ae0fa","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This maneuver allows a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," to get down beneath a larger ship's shields, dealing damage that bypasses shields and directly impacts on the hull.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," One ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," of Colossal (Frigate) or larger in size whose ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"}," you fly through.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check."]}," You may ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," up to twice your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"},", passing through the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"}," before ending your turn in an unoccupied square. When you enter the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fighting Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fighting_Space","referenceId":"reference:cdbf34043baceb78"},", you attempt to dip below the target's shields, allowing you to make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Attack"}," against the target that ignores the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},". You take a penalty on your attack roll while making this attack, determined by the result of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You take a -10 penalty on your attack roll.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You take a -5 penalty on your attack roll.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["30\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You take a -2 penalty on your attack roll.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["35\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You take a -1 penalty on your attack roll.\n"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," check result to activate ",{"tag":"i","children":["Skim the Surface"]}," is 19 or lower, you collide with the target ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," (see ",{"tag":"a","children":["Collisions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Collisions","referenceId":"reference:38a01513f532d9ed"},"). You may not attempt to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Avoid Collision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Avoid_Collision"},", but the target may do so if it wishes.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," aboard a ship using ",{"tag":"i","children":["Skim the Surface"]}," that have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Readied"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Readied"}," an Action during the maneuver may take their attacks when the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," does. Such attacks ignore SR and take the same penalties on the attack roll as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"}," does. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," who ",{"tag":"a","children":["Readies"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Readies"}," an Action to attack in this way moves his or her place in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative_Order"}," to immediately before the Vehicle Pilot's, as normal.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
